{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_04_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:095af0319477a17211c13c199df1bb7cf94bf008426b3c88d196c68b757f6dab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb8dd0187a7c8671387adbfb8a47d28abce0f4f6fe880ca5a1fd8b75332d9051",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n薰先生，课程进展得怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74f8b3194f05459a0ab9edec2a95257949796610015ae416960fd8b2229abadd",
      "text": "高音的延展度不够。\n今天必须练到能唱出来为止。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6889c44b92e7cf1ece8cdd4f9f21a5e8ce1cf732e5b01e6fa6f71d29bb1e287a",
      "text": "啊！？\n别对快70岁的老头子提无理的要求！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d38144b6a7559a95f947765051b51e99f1b7463e173db8324d8b5b30588819",
      "text": "在做之前就说什么“无理”，\n那不管过多久都解决不了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cdc99d104bab9dc76302374f6267cd07167eea9cb13db179c5375d7d9de12c5",
      "text": "态度就不能好点吗！你这家伙，\n要是面对自己的父亲也能下这种狠手吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9409011075b4d42c65894425aa16410c8d248fa502c46807488aab0a799e76a",
      "text": "……。呵。\n被你这么一说，我才想起还有父亲这种存在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28b6b5b87c5bb2ba0cdd43d34434a4cb7b6785211cf858582229827bdff56f5c",
      "text": "如果你是我父亲，\n我甚至都不会像现在这样跟你扯上关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0766b1af89110d1213b0bbd5be7a75c62b1a0eeacdd127f383a35ebb8957cd3d",
      "text": "啊、啊……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b5f3eeedcec4e5f816c58ce61a916af3602022720fcbc490b04e064a763213b",
      "text": "（……那个人是个‘没能拯救’的人。\n我不一样。我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74e36fd540a59ca16f2ca11536081e5add1feb14468465c8bb9addbc331e566a",
      "text": "……少废话，继续练习。\n在正式演出前，必须达到完美的水平。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e886c7e9a2210f4270f57db3375b18ab8c7ceb95f490afa6b3403d1fe51d5f6",
      "text": "那、那个，薰先生。\n要不要稍微休息一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c20b68b9dabccb0e049cd164a2b0c93924c2bce09920f521ecbb30c163194f",
      "text": "嗯。休息也是练习的一部分。\n老爷爷和薰先生，现在都先休息一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7243aec278bd1b63d56cd95cd7df3446bf84cc8fc7dac52771e9e6c8fd77883",
      "text": "哼，那是当然！真是的，\n应付狂妄的小鬼真累人。那我走了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6f8f41c523d68bb6e91a25cd87093ceed8531e021cba92c15b2bc38555813b4",
      "text": "喂，练习才刚开始啊。\n谁准你擅自决定的……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d7e15bc9ff7932170249a9fb617bde805d23978cac5e38fe8b616323e5c349c",
      "text": "樱庭。对偶像来说，除了‘完美’之外\n应该还有更重要的东西吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
